<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1F">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "06">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1616014" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Radiator Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1616013">Radiator On-Vehicle Inspection and Cleaning:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1616014001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove radiator cooling fan assembly. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616011"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine under side covers.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intercooler. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1 page = "2">
<ptxt>
Remove condenser upper and lower bolts. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A7206043"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The A/C condenser assembly may be damaged if it hits against or interferes with other parts.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Suspend the removed A/C condenser assembly in a place where no damage will be caused during removal and installation of the radiator.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect radiator inlet hose (1) from radiator.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164020.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.329mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "135"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Support front lower crossmember (1) with jack (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front lower crossmember bolts (3), and then lower jack and remove radiator with front lower crossmember.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164021.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.989mm" ver = "01" gw = "228" gh = "137"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove radiator from front lower crossmember.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove radiator left bracket (1) and radiator right bracket (2) from radiator, if necessary.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A164022.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.329mm" ver = "01" gw = "207" gh = "135"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1616014002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Install front lower crossmember. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A9806003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
If there is matchmark on each of hose and pipe, install the hose aligning matchmark on hose with matchmark on pipe and then install each clamp in proper position.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Refill cooling system with coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check cooling system for leakage. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
